<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Chip stared at the message for a long moment before deleting it. He walked to the kitchen and faced the stasis unit he'd been avoiding. With a deep breath, he removed the decorative screen and opened the unit's maintenance panel.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>If Fridge Force was coming for him, he'd be ready. And if Eloise Shakti thought she owned him now, she'd learn that Chip Stockwell had picked up more than just technical knowledge during his years in Fridge Enforcement..
